            <mxCell id="Legend" value="Trust boundaries (SAD-03)&#xa;TB1 Browser to gateway: HTTPS, same-origin, opaque session cookie plus CSRF&#xa;TB2 Gateway to Knowledge: internal HTTP, service key plus validated actor context; Knowledge policy checks to Workspace fail closed (deny)&#xa;TB3 Service to its own database: separate credentials, no cross-database writes&#xa;TB4 Workspace to provider: HTTPS, guarded relay, server-held key&#xa;Only Workspace is publicly exposed in the initial deployment" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=13;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="450" width="780" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
